---
// CPU cache line spatial locality (Slice of Structs vs Struct of Slices) and False Sharing across cores.
const W = 900;
const H = 350;
---
<figure class="gpcc">
  <div class="gpcc-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Top: Spatial locality showing Slice of Structs wasting cache line bytes on unused fields versus Struct of Slices packing hot int64 values contiguously. Bottom: False sharing where Core 0 and Core 1 invalidate a shared 64-byte cache line.">
      {/* Top: Spatial locality */}
      <text x="20" y="26" class="gpcc-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Spatial locality: Slice of Structs ([]Foo) vs. Struct of Slices (Bar) on a 64-byte cache line</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Spatial locality: Slice of Structs ([]Foo) vs. Struct of Slices (Bar) trên một CPU cache line 64 byte</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="20" y="44" width="420" height="106" rx="8" class="gpcc-card is-warn" />
      <text x="36" y="68" class="gpcc-warn">[]Foo {'{'} a int64; b int64 {'}'} — summing only .a</text>
      {[0, 1, 2, 3].map((i) => (
        <g>
          <rect x={36 + i * 96} y="82" width="44" height="32" rx="4" class="gpcc-hot" />
          <text x={58 + i * 96} y="102" text-anchor="middle" class="gpcc-b">a{i}</text>
          <rect x={82 + i * 96} y="82" width="44" height="32" rx="4" class="gpcc-cold" />
          <text x={104 + i * 96} y="102" text-anchor="middle" class="gpcc-sm">b{i}</text>
        </g>
      ))}
      <text x="36" y="136" class="gpcc-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>50% of every fetched cache line is wasted loading unused b fields</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>50% dung lượng cache line bị lãng phí cho trường b không dùng tới</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="460" y="44" width="420" height="106" rx="8" class="gpcc-card is-ok" />
      <text x="476" y="68" class="gpcc-ok">Bar {'{'} a []int64; b []int64 {'}'} — contiguous .a</text>
      {[0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7].map((i) => (
        <g>
          <rect x={476 + i * 48} y="82" width="44" height="32" rx="4" class="gpcc-hot" />
          <text x={498 + i * 48} y="102" text-anchor="middle" class="gpcc-b">a{i}</text>
        </g>
      ))}
      <text x="476" y="136" class="gpcc-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>8 values fit per 64B line — CPU prefetcher streams cleanly</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nhét gọn 8 phần tử mỗi line 64B — CPU nạp trước tối đa tốc độ</tspan>
      </text>

      <line x1="20" x2={W - 20} y1="172" y2="172" class="gpcc-rule" />

      {/* Bottom: False sharing */}
      <text x="20" y="200" class="gpcc-h-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. False sharing: independent variables sharing a cache line ping-pong between CPU cores</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. False sharing: hai biến độc lập nằm chung một cache line liên tục phá cache của nhau</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="14" y="218" width="426" height="114" rx="8" class="gpcc-card is-red" />
      <text x="30" y="242" class="gpcc-b-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Unpadded counters (22.2 ms on Apple M2)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Không đệm cache line (22,2 ms trên Apple M2)</tspan>
      </text>
      <rect x="30" y="256" width="394" height="44" rx="6" class="gpcc-linebox is-red" />
      <rect x="38" y="264" width="110" height="28" rx="4" class="gpcc-hot" />
      <text x="93" y="283" text-anchor="middle" class="gpcc-b">Core 0: s.a++</text>
      <rect x="158" y="264" width="110" height="28" rx="4" class="gpcc-hot" />
      <text x="213" y="283" text-anchor="middle" class="gpcc-b">Core 1: s.b++</text>
      <text x="348" y="283" text-anchor="middle" class="gpcc-b-red">SAME LINE</text>
      <text x="30" y="318" class="gpcc-sm">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Every write to s.a invalidates Core 1's entire L1 cache line</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi lần Core 0 ghi s.a lập tức hủy cache line của Core 1</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="460" y="218" width="426" height="114" rx="8" class="gpcc-card is-ok" />
      <text x="476" y="242" class="gpcc-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Cache-line padded (10.3 ms — 2.1x faster!)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tách cache line bằng padding (10,3 ms — nhanh hơn 2,1 lần!)</tspan>
      </text>
      <rect x="476" y="256" width="116" height="44" rx="6" class="gpcc-linebox is-ok" />
      <text x="534" y="283" text-anchor="middle" class="gpcc-b">Core 0: s.a++</text>
      <rect x="602" y="256" width="140" height="44" rx="6" class="gpcc-cold" />
      <text x="672" y="283" text-anchor="middle" class="gpcc-sm">cpu.CacheLinePad</text>
      <rect x="752" y="256" width="116" height="44" rx="6" class="gpcc-linebox is-ok" />
      <text x="810" y="283" text-anchor="middle" class="gpcc-b">Core 1: s.b++</text>
      <text x="476" y="318" class="gpcc-ok">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Zero cross-core cache invalidation traffic</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hai nhân cập nhật L1 độc lập không đụng chạm nhau</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>CPUs fetch and invalidate memory in 64-byte (x86) or 128-byte (Apple Silicon) cache lines, never single bytes. Pack read-hot fields together, and separate write-hot concurrent counters onto distinct cache lines.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>CPU nạp và xóa hiệu lực bộ nhớ theo từng khối cache line 64 byte (x86) hoặc 128 byte (Apple Silicon), không phải từng byte lẻ. Hãy xếp liền các trường hay đọc chung, và tách các bộ đếm ghi song song sang hai cache line riêng biệt.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gpcc { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gpcc-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gpcc svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gpcc text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gpcc-h { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gpcc-h-red { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gpcc-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .gpcc-card.is-warn { stroke: var(--gold); }
  .gpcc-card.is-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .gpcc-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gpcc-card.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gpcc-hot { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gpcc-cold { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .gpcc-linebox { fill: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .gpcc-linebox.is-red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .gpcc-linebox.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gpcc-linebox.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gpcc-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gpcc-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gpcc-warn { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .gpcc-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gpcc-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gpcc-sm { font-size: 11.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gpcc-rule { stroke: var(--border); }
  .gpcc figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
